WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:06,280
Don't think too much. You are right. These years

2
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,400
I just want Tingting to have books to read and food to eat

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,560
I never thought that she also had her own thoughts as a girl

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,700
It's me, the older brother, who didn't do a good job

5
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:15,710
You don’t have to say that

6
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,870
How can you, a grown man, know everything?

7
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:23,710
I'll teach you these things from now on. Thank you. Okay. Okay.

8
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:25,870
Don't be so polite all of a sudden

9
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,270
How much do these things cost?

10
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:31,890
When I get paid, I'll pay you back two hundred and fifty, how much?

11
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:33,570
two hundred and five

12
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:42,140
We've already agreed to ask for leave tomorrow.

13
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,540
No need to rush back to class

14
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,260
Brother, I want to go back

15
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,700
Isn’t Teacher Li going to apologize publicly tomorrow?

16
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:49,860
I want to hear it with my own ears

17
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:52,450
Don't put too much pressure on yourself

18
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:56,410
If you need anything, please call us. Thank you, sister-in-law. Don’t scream.

19
00:00:58,090 --> 00:01:00,530
Brother, sister-in-law is so good, you have to hurry up.

20
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:03,300
Tingting, you really misunderstood

21
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:04,940
I know, I know, you are all shy

22
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:09,620
Brother, sister-in-law, bye, this girl is sorry.

23
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:12,100
I don’t blame her for being so young and speaking so freely.

24
00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:15,430
It was me who said this first. Thank you today.

25
00:01:15,790 --> 00:01:20,010
Tingting hasn't been so happy for a long time. Let's go home.

26
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:27,180
I'm exhausted. Take a shower.
